class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">全</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">全</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">半</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>&quot;全全半全全全半&quot;——这就是大调音阶的音程结构。无论从哪个音开始，只要按照这个间距排列，听起来都是&quot;do re mi fa sol la si do&quot;的感觉。</p>\n<p><strong>升号与降号</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>升号（♯）：将音升高半音。如 C♯ 在 C 和 D 之间</li>\n<li>降号（♭）：将音降低半音。如 D♭ 也在 C 和 D 之间</li>\n<li>C♯ 和 D♭ 在钢琴上是同一个键（等音）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-节奏与节拍\">二、节奏与节拍</h3><p><strong>拍号</strong>：写在乐谱开头的分数形式数字。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拍号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>节奏特点</th>\n<th>常见应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每小节 2 拍，四分音符为一拍</td>\n<td>强-弱</td>\n<td>进行曲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每小节 3 拍</td>\n<td>强-弱-弱</td>\n<td>华尔兹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每小节 4 拍</td>\n<td>强-弱-次强-弱</td>\n<td>流行歌曲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{6}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每小节 6 个八分音符</td>\n<td>复合拍</td>\n<td>摇篮曲、船歌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>音符的时值</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音符</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>时值（以四分音符=1拍）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>𝅝</td>\n<td>全音符</td>\n<td>4 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>𝅗𝅥</td>\n<td>二分音符</td>\n<td>2 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>♩</td>\n<td>四分音符</td>\n<td>1 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>♪</td>\n<td>八分音符</td>\n<td>1/2 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>𝅘𝅥𝅯</td>\n<td>十六分音符</td>\n<td>1/4 拍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>附点</strong>：音符后加一个点，时值增加原来的一半。如附点二分音符 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 + 1 = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 拍。</p>\n<p><strong>休止符</strong>：表示沉默的时间。每种音符都有对应的休止符。音乐中的&quot;留白&quot;和绘画中的留白一样重要——贝多芬就善于用突然的静默制造戏剧性效果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-音程与和弦\">三、音程与和弦</h3><p><strong>音程</strong>：两个音之间的距离。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音程</th>\n<th>半音数</th>\n<th>听感</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯一度</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>同音</td>\n<td>C-C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小二度</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>紧张、刺耳</td>\n<td>E-F</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大二度</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>柔和的步进</td>\n<td>C-D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小三度</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>忧伤</td>\n<td>A-C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大三度</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>明朗</td>\n<td>C-E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯四度</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>空旷、庄严</td>\n<td>C-F</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯五度</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>空旷、和谐</td>\n<td>C-G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯八度</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>完全和谐</td>\n<td>C-高音 C</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>和弦</strong>：三个或以上的音同时发响。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大三和弦</strong>（如 C-E-G）：明亮、愉快</li>\n<li><strong>小三和弦</strong>（如 A-C-E）：暗淡、忧伤</li>\n<li><strong>属七和弦</strong>（如 G-B-D-F）：不稳定，有强烈的&quot;需要解决&quot;的倾向</li>\n</ul>\n<p>试试在钢琴或键盘上弹奏 C 大三和弦（do-mi-sol）和 C 小三和弦（do-降 mi-sol），直接感受大调的明亮和小调的忧伤——这就是和声色彩的力量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-调式与调性\">四、调式与调性</h3><p><strong>大调</strong>与<strong>小调</strong>是西方音乐中最常见的两种调式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大调音阶：全全半全全全半（如 C 大调：C D E F G A B C）</li>\n<li>自然小调音阶：全半全全半全全（如 A 小调：A B C D E F G A）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>调性决定了音乐的&quot;基调&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大调作品</strong>常给人明亮、开朗、积极的感觉（如《欢乐颂》）</li>\n<li><strong>小调作品</strong>常给人忧伤、深沉、内省的感觉（如《月光奏鸣曲》第一乐章）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>中国传统五声调式</strong>使用五个音：宫、商、角、徵、羽（对应 do、re、mi、sol、la），没有半音进行（没有 fa 和 si），因此听起来比西方七声音阶更加空灵开阔。《茉莉花》《高山流水》等经典中国乐曲都建立在五声调式之上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-乐谱的读写\">五、乐谱的读写</h3><p><strong>五线谱基础</strong>：</p>\n<p>五条平行线由下到上编号为第一线到第五线，线与线之间为&quot;间&quot;。音符在线和间上的位置决定音高。</p>\n<p>高音谱号（G 谱号）规定第二线上的音为 G（sol）。由此可推算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一线：E（mi）</li>\n<li>第一间：F（fa）</li>\n<li>第二线：G（sol）</li>\n<li>第二间：A（la）</li>\n<li>第三线：B（si）</li>\n<li>……以此类推</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>简谱基础</strong>：</p>\n<p>中国使用的简谱系统以数字 1-7 代表 do-si，数字上方加点表示高八度，下方加点表示低八度。横线减少时值（下划线），附点增加时值。</p>\n<p>简谱的优势是简洁易读，特别适合歌唱；五线谱的优势是能精确表示复杂的和声和多声部，是器乐演奏的通用语言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-音乐记号与术语\">六、音乐记号与术语</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>piano</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>forte</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>crescendo</td>\n<td>渐强</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cresc.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">esc</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>diminuendo</td>\n<td>渐弱</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dim.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>allegro</td>\n<td>快板</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>andante</td>\n<td>行板（中速）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>adagio</td>\n<td>慢板</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>legato</td>\n<td>连奏</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>staccato</td>\n<td>断奏</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些意大利语术语是全世界音乐家的通用语言——无论在北京、维也纳还是纽约，乐谱上写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 就意味着&quot;强奏&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在钢琴或手机钢琴 App 上弹出 C 大调音阶（C D E F G A B C），感受&quot;全全半全全全半&quot;的音程结构。然后尝试从 G 开始，用相同的音程结构弹出 G 大调音阶。你需要使用哪些升降号？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用节拍器（手机 App 可以替代）设定速度为 80 BPM（每分钟 80 拍），练习稳定地跟随节拍拍手。然后尝试每拍拍两下（八分音符节奏）和每拍拍四下（十六分音符节奏）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>听一首你喜欢的歌曲，尝试判断它的拍号：是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拍（节奏感强、适合点头）还是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拍（有&quot;荡秋千&quot;的感觉）？歌曲是大调（明亮）还是小调（忧伤）？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>找一首简单歌曲的简谱（如《两只老虎》或《小星星》），尝试在钢琴或键盘上弹出来。注意音符时值的长短变化。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分别听一段中国传统五声调式的乐曲和一段西方大调音阶的乐曲，比较两者给你的不同感受。你能用语言描述这种差异吗？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>乐理知识不仅能帮助你理解古典音乐，也能让你更深入地欣赏流行音乐。许多脍炙人口的流行歌曲都使用了简洁但有效的和声进行——如 I-V-vi-IV（C-G-Am-F）被戏称为&quot;四个和弦写百首歌&quot;，从《Let It Be》到《Someone Like You》，无数热门歌曲都建立在这个和弦进行之上。</p>\n<p>推荐探索的方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>音乐可视化工具</strong>：如 Synthesia（钢琴学习软件）可以将乐谱变成直观的&quot;下落式&quot;动画</li>\n<li><strong>12tone 频道</strong>（YouTube）：用简洁有趣的动画解释各种乐理概念和歌曲分析</li>\n<li><strong>尝试作曲</strong>：用 GarageBand（iPhone/Mac 免费）或 MuseScore（免费乐谱编辑软件）写一段简单的旋律</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>乐理是音乐的语法系统。音高通过十二平均律和音阶组织，节奏通过节拍和音符时值安排，和声通过音程和和弦构建色彩。大调明亮、小调忧伤，中国五声调式空灵开阔。五线谱和简谱是记录音乐的两种书写系统，音乐术语（力度、速度等）是全球通用的演奏指令。掌握这些基础知识，你就拥有了一副&quot;音乐的眼镜&quot;——听到的将不仅是好听的声音，而是有结构、有逻辑、有情感的音乐语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一艺术 — 乐理基础","id":"高一艺术-乐理基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、音高与音名","id":"一-音高与音名"},{"level":3,"text":"二、节奏与节拍","id":"二-节奏与节拍"},{"level":3,"text":"三、音程与和弦","id":"三-音程与和弦"},{"level":3,"text":"四、调式与调性","id":"四-调式与调性"},{"level":3,"text":"五、乐谱的读写","id":"五-乐谱的读写"},{"level":3,"text":"六、音乐记号与术语","id":"六-音乐记号与术语"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一艺术 — 数字艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/arts/creative-practice/digital-art"},"next":{"title":"高一艺术 — 声乐训练","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/arts/music-performance/vocal-training"}}